@startuml checkout
!include style.iuml

|Cashier (Android)|
start
repeat
	:Add products by search or scan;
	:Choose or register a customer;
	|Server|
	:Price the cart;
	|Cashier (Android)|
repeat while (Change the cart?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
:Tap Charge;
|Server|
:Merge repeated lines;
:Lock product rows in id order;
if (Every line active, unexpired and in stock?) then ([yes])
	:Apply discount and tax;
	:Save order, items, stock changes and movements;
	:Commit and return the receipt;
else ([no])
	:Roll back and return the problem;
endif
|Cashier (Android)|
:Show the receipt or the problem;
stop
@enduml